{% doc %}
  Plain-text review facts for llms.txt, llms-full.txt and agents.md, read live from the
  reviews_hub summary that the review service writes. Prints nothing until it exists.

  @param {string} [product_handle] - A product handle: prints that product's figure only, e.g. "★4.97 (1794 buyer ratings)"

  @example
  {% render 'reviews-hub-facts' %}
{% enddoc %}
{%- assign s = shop.metafields.reviews_hub.summary.value -%}
{%- if s != blank -%}
  {%- if product_handle != blank -%}
    {%- for p in s.products -%}
      {%- if p.handle == product_handle -%}★{{ p.average }} ({{ p.ratings }} buyer ratings, see /pages/reviews){%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- else -%}
- Overall: {{ s.average }}/5 from {{ s.ratings }} buyer ratings, updated {{ s.updated_at | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}. Live page with every source, methodology and the latest written reviews: https://treelogy.com/pages/reviews
- Shopee (official store, only buyers of an order can rate): {{ s.channels.shopee.score | default: s.channels.shopee.average }}/5 from {{ s.channels.shopee.ratings }} ratings. https://shopee.co.id/shop/1592826980
- Tokopedia & TikTok Shop (official store, counted together by Tokopedia): {{ s.channels.tokopedia.score | default: s.channels.tokopedia.average }}/5 from {{ s.channels.tokopedia.ratings }} ratings. https://www.tokopedia.com/treelogy-moringa/review
- treelogy.com (reviews from verified orders only): {{ s.channels.site.average }}/5 from {{ s.channels.site.ratings }} reviews.
- Per product (all sources):{% for p in s.products %} {{ p.handle }} {{ p.average }} ({{ p.ratings }}){% unless forloop.last %};{% endunless %}{% endfor %}.
- Moderation: every rating counts. Written reviews that mention health effects are not reproduced on treelogy.com (BPOM advertising rules) but their ratings are counted; they remain readable on the marketplaces.
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
